  "body": "Please add the `default` attribute for `<input type=\"submit\" default=\"default\"/>` and `<button type=\"submit\" default=\"default\"></button>` to point the default button in case of hitting ENTER in other control to submit the form. \r\n\r\nWithout it the submit button must be doubled on the website if other submit buttons are provided for part of the form. \r\n\r\nBTW. Please also specify behaviour for browsers with GUI, that after hitting the ENTER, the default button gets focus before reloading site (like in IE11). I use Firefox/Chrome where this functionionality is missing but in IE11 is very appreciated. ",
